{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After an unforeseen disaster occurs in a futuristic mining complex you find yourself stranded with nothing but the tool of your trade; a reliable old shovel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Burrow and dig your way through a sequence of strange and unfamiliar spaces as you search for answers and escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The short atmospheric experience includes :<br>-Voxel dirt blocks</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Ghosts of classical composers</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Extremely fast creatures</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Multiple tools</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-MIDI soundtrack</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some of the control options available include :</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Walking</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Jumping</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Looking</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Digging</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3869670?t=1773854733","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3869670?t=1773854733","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3869670/20d959990331cb9f6647eb706ef3c4dd4834a44d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773854733","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3869670/20d959990331cb9f6647eb706ef3c4dd4834a44d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773854733","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Contains depictions of corpses, blood, violence, death, nudity, immoral behavi